title The fold that cost nothing on every axis, and the rung that stayed home on its merits
prompt Autonomous loop -- read the voice and Radiant Style, the operator card, the itineraries, the newest logs' recommend line; close open agent-closable reds first; take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first; deep-read one council-rota row; sweep the prose Radiant; send each finished increment.
think Standfast first. Walked crux/REDS.md living rows 133 onward: %137, %138, and %139 each carry a CLOSED companion row with a witness on metal. No open agent-closable red stands, so the constructive queue opens honestly.
think The running thread came off the top three rows of session-logs/README.md and the newest recommend: the Caravan ladder lift arc, with look_again named as the head at five hundred and twenty-eight and the standing instruction to read its body against the harness before lifting, since twelve rungs of fifty-one lines is the longest single body the arc has folded.
think Read the body before trusting the number. Thirteen rungs declare look_again; twelve wrote byte-identical bodies and reweigh.rye differs in six lines. The difference is real rather than drift -- reweigh.rye is the originating rung, whose own Report IS the reweigh report, so it writes report_out.looked directly where the twelve above it reach through reweigh_of(report_out). It keeps its body; the twelve fold around it.
think Priced the door before opening it, per REDS %137's lesson. The reach scan read widens=0 across every kind -- no function, no import, no constant -- because all fourteen symbols the body reaches already stand pub on all twelve rungs. Confirmed by hand against abate.rye before writing a line: every one of the fourteen carries a pub qualifier, and all four types do too.
think The lift itself: look_again moved into caravan/ladder_checks.rye as pub fn look_again(comptime rung: type, io: std.Io, reweigh: rung.Reweigh, report_out: *rung.Report) (rung.RunError || rung.NoteError)!void, every helper call qualified through rung. Each of the twelve rungs keeps a three-line stub returning ladder_checks.look_again(@This(), io, reweigh, report_out).
think Ran the twelve rung witnesses, then the choir rather than only the witnesses the change touched -- the lesson two laps wrote in a row. The choir named two meters standing above their own numbers, which is the fold working: the carry ceiling and the reach-visibility witness both pinned look_again as the pre-fold head.
think Every meter moved with the fold rather than after it: the carry ceiling to 67,831, the sink corpus to 65,419, farewell.rye's holding from 3,901 to 3,853. The reach witness's free-head block was repointed from look_again to revoke_one, so the queue's head stays asserted rather than recited.
obs The corrected fall formula predicted 528 and the carry fell exactly 528: 68,359 to 67,831. Its second live use, its second exact hit. The formula that names three body populations rather than two is holding.
obs This is the first family the arc has folded that widens nothing of any kind -- widens_fn, widens_import, and widens_const all zero. Fifty-one lines is the longest single body the arc has lifted and also the cheapest, which is the split widening column earning its keep: length and cost are separate facts, and a row can lead one column while trailing the other.
obs The rung that stayed home is the interesting half. A body that differs in six lines could read as drift to a meter counting only identity; reading it showed the difference is structural, since the originating rung's own report is the report the twelve above it reach for. A fold that flattened it would have been wrong, and only reading the diff says so.
obs Two windows fell by different amounts and both are honest: the carry meter counts copies and fell 528, while the sink meter counts total foldable body lines and fell 576, which is twelve rungs times the forty-eight lines a stub replaces. Naming which window a number belongs to is what keeps three meters from reading as one disagreement.
obs Closed a ratchet on touch: read_own_line's own doc block still described the fold-line cost in prose -- the exact sentence REDS %137 booked -- while the witness and the card had both been repaired. The doc now carries the sink measurement. A red repaired in two places out of three is a red half closed.
obs The queue reordered and the next head is revoke_one at four hundred and sixty-eight: forty rungs of twenty-one lines, every one of its forty widenings binding cycle, a module ladder_checks.rye already imports itself. Free on the same reading this lap gave.
